<%# app/views/job_alert_mailer/new_matches.text.erb %>
IntelliJob

Hello,

Here are your latest job matches:
<% @applications.each do |application| -%>
<% job = application.job -%>

<%= job.title %>
<%= job.company %><%= ", #{job.location}" if job.location.present? %>
<% unless application.score.nil? -%>
Match: <%= (application.score * 100).round %>%
<% end -%>
<% if job.url.to_s.start_with?("http://", "https://") -%>
APPLY: <%= job.url %>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

Dashboard: <%= dashboard_url %>

You are receiving this email because job alerts are turned on for your IntelliJob account.
Unsubscribe: <%= unsubscribe_url(token: @user.signed_id(purpose: :unsubscribe)) %>